<title>FINLAND: HELASTO BUYS LAATURUUVI FOR FIM 3.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>HELASTO BUYS LAATURUUVI FOR FIM 3.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish security device manufacturer Suomen Helasto Oy said on Friday it had bought nuts and bolts wholesaler Helsingin Laaturuuvi for 3.5 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Suomen Helasto has bought Helsingin Laaturuuvi's share capital from the company's owners,&quot; Helasto said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Of the purchase price, 20 percent will be paid in Suomen Helasto shares to one of the owners after which he will own 1.3 percent in the company, Helasto said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
